      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The issue shown on image 5 seems to have been fixed in the latest build [1003]\n\"Additionally, moving to the left and right will make the chest rotate towards that direction when the user stops\"\nTo clarify, on Live, when you stop moving it snaps the character towards the direction you're facing. In the current build [1003] it snaps to the front and then corrects itself to the direction you last moved in\nNow includes a comparison with Live vs Beta",
      "viewerReactions": null
