  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-10-22T18:22:32.702Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This does not happen on Live, but it did happen before the IK was \"fixed\" on Live\n\nAvatars' legs will start moving backwards, making the character look like its slightly leaning (image 1)\nRemoving toe bones will cause the avatar's foot IK to stabilize forwards (image 2)\n\nLeg IK for 2.0 avatars also regressed (image 3) on the beta compared to Live (image 4) (which is also still broken because the idle animation isn't meant to spread the avatar's legs like that)\n\nAdditionally, moving to the left and right will make the chest rotate towards that direction when the user stops, and doing it while being crouched will cause legs to be misplaced (image 5)\nThis also happens without auto footsteps",
